00:24:28.509 --> 00:24:30.176
But if you look around at all these people


00:24:30.636 --> 00:24:32.512
taking their lives for granted,


00:24:33.180 --> 00:24:37.642
eventually they all found something positive
from their experience.


00:24:37.726 --> 00:24:40.186
We should never be ashamed
of what we've gone through,


00:24:40.271 --> 00:24:43.022
because we are good and we are strong!


00:24:45.693 --> 00:24:47.110
You know what?


00:24:47.194 --> 00:24:50.822
I'd like everybody to have
a look at something right here.


00:24:51.574 --> 00:24:54.200
These are my scars.


00:24:56.871 --> 00:24:58.788
Because our minds will heal,


00:25:00.541 --> 00:25:02.041
but these scars will never go away.


00:25:03.210 --> 00:25:06.254
These scars should not be
a symbol of shame.


00:25:06.338 --> 00:25:08.256
They should be worn as a badge of courage.


00:25:10.718 --> 00:25:12.010
You know, earlier,


00:25:12.094 --> 00:25:17.223
I spoke of valuing your loved ones.


00:25:18.559 --> 00:25:19.976
But to be perfectly honest,


00:25:20.060 --> 00:25:22.979
it's something that I never did
prior to my ordeal.


00:25:23.063 --> 00:25:24.606
But since then,


00:25:25.357 --> 00:25:29.652
I have found someone
who has truly become my rock.


00:25:32.865 --> 00:25:33.907
Joyce, if you could...


00:25:35.367 --> 00:25:36.367
Please.


00:25:39.371 --> 00:25:41.497
It's my lovely wife Joyce.


00:25:42.750 --> 00:25:45.710
- I love you.
- I love you too, baby.


00:25:57.014 --> 00:25:58.348
Bravo.


00:25:59.391 --> 00:26:02.393
To be able to sustain
such a traumatic experience,


00:26:02.478 --> 00:26:06.773
and yet find the positive in that grizzly act,


00:26:07.608 --> 00:26:09.943
it's a remarkable feat indeed.


00:26:12.613 --> 00:26:14.447
Remarkable,


00:26:15.616 --> 00:26:17.784
if not a little perverse.


00:26:20.120 --> 00:26:23.122
I'm sure I speak for everyone
here when I say


00:26:23.207 --> 00:26:25.750
how grateful we are


00:26:26.377 --> 00:26:31.339
to be part of your promotional DVD.


00:26:38.931 --> 00:26:41.140
I appreciate it. Thank you. It's...


00:26:48.148 --> 00:26:50.650
- I can take that, sir.
- Thank you very much.


00:26:51.151 --> 00:26:52.443
Joyce, can I borrow him for a second?


00:26:52.528 --> 00:26:53.861
Sure. I'll be in the car, okay?


00:26:53.946 --> 00:26:55.113
Two minutes behind you.


00:26:55.197 --> 00:26:56.447
- Great.
- You'll see her to the car, please, sir?


00:26:56.532 --> 00:26:58.366
- Of course.
- Thank you.


00:26:59.660 --> 00:27:00.868
What's up?


00:27:00.953 --> 00:27:03.454
So what's with the creepy guy with the
cane? Someone I should know about?


00:27:03.539 --> 00:27:05.581
No, no, no. He's been at these meetings
longer than I have.


00:27:05.666 --> 00:27:06.833
He's fine.


00:27:08.127 --> 00:27:09.210
All right.


00:27:10.004 --> 00:27:11.921
Listen, get back to the hotel,
and get some rest, all right?


00:27:12.006 --> 00:27:14.007
Yeah. Everything's fine.


00:27:14.633 --> 00:27:15.758
Great work tonight, Bobby.


00:27:15.843 --> 00:27:17.552
- Thank you.
- You're the man.


00:27:31.692 --> 00:27:32.859
Joyce?


00:27:39.199 --> 00:27:40.533
What happened to him?


00:27:42.369 --> 00:27:45.288
They always tell you not to smoke
at the gas station.


00:27:45.372 --> 00:27:48.207
- This should wrap up the week for you.
- Great.


00:27:53.922 --> 00:27:54.922
What's up, man?


00:27:55.716 --> 00:27:57.717
I'm at a junkyard on 58th.


00:27:57.926 --> 00:27:59.010
Why?


00:27:59.094 --> 00:28:00.636
Call came in about a car crash.


00:28:00.721 --> 00:28:02.889
Car crash? Why are you there?


00:28:03.557 --> 00:28:04.766
It's not just a car crash.


00:28:04.850 --> 00:28:06.142
It's a trap.


00:28:06.226 --> 00:28:07.810
How many bodies?


00:28:08.562 --> 00:28:10.063
Enough pieces to make four.


00:28:10.606 --> 00:28:13.149
Okay, get everyone away
from that crime scene till I get there.


00:28:13.233 --> 00:28:15.068
- Even Homicide, you got it?
- Yeah.


00:28:15.152 --> 00:28:16.652
All right, I'm on the way.


00:28:18.947 --> 00:28:22.283
Hello, Evan. I want to play a game.


00:28:22.368 --> 00:28:24.911
The situation you find yourself in...


00:28:26.538 --> 00:28:28.748
You, your girlfriend...


00:28:31.752 --> 00:28:37.340
You have intimidated others
based on their physical differences.


00:28:54.900 --> 00:28:56.776
So, what do you think?


00:28:57.403 --> 00:28:58.444
Why?


00:28:59.071 --> 00:29:00.780
Why this display?


00:29:01.740 --> 00:29:03.366
Why them? Why now?


00:29:03.784 --> 00:29:05.952
You know he likes to put on a show.


00:29:06.578 --> 00:29:08.955
Well, there's gotta be something else.


00:29:16.964 --> 00:29:19.841
Bag the other bodies. Get them back
to the coroner's office right away.


00:29:19.925 --> 00:29:22.176
We'll need them checked
for anything resembling a clue.


00:29:22.261 --> 00:29:25.346
Tattoos, piercings, skin cuttings.


00:29:25.431 --> 00:29:28.599
If that man has a cavity in his tooth,
I want to know about it.


00:29:28.684 --> 00:29:29.934
- Yes, sir.
- All right.


00:29:30.018 --> 00:29:31.269
Gibson.


00:29:31.687 --> 00:29:33.146
Yeah?


00:29:33.522 --> 00:29:35.189
Hoffman was expecting you.


00:29:38.527 --> 00:29:39.986
God damn.


00:29:42.906 --> 00:29:43.990
Would you look at that?


00:29:45.325 --> 00:29:46.826
Please get forensics in here.


00:29:47.286 --> 00:29:48.995
Tell them to haul ass.


00:29:49.204 --> 00:29:51.330
This needs to be dusted for prints.


00:29:52.249 --> 00:29:53.666
- All right.
- Okay.


00:30:28.202 --> 00:30:29.327
Help!


00:30:47.846 --> 00:30:48.888
Hello, Bobby.


00:30:50.599 --> 00:30:51.891
I want to play a game.


00:30:52.851 --> 00:30:56.479
You have amassed wealth, fame,
and notoriety,


00:30:56.563 --> 00:30:59.398
based upon your story of survival.


00:30:59.483 --> 00:31:04.320
Many have aided in your cause,
but few know the truth.


00:31:04.404 --> 00:31:06.489
You are a liar.


00:31:06.573 --> 00:31:09.367
You and I both know
you have never been in a trap,


00:31:09.451 --> 00:31:11.869
nor have you ever been tested.


00:31:13.372 --> 00:31:17.625
Today these lies will come full circle
and you will learn


00:31:18.085 --> 00:31:22.672
if you truly have what it takes
to call yourself a survivor.


00:31:23.674 --> 00:31:25.508
The cage you find yourself in


00:31:25.592 --> 00:31:27.677
will symbolize your rebirth.


00:31:30.472 --> 00:31:31.847
Joyce? No!


00:31:33.433 --> 00:31:36.102
Joyce! No!


00:31:36.186 --> 00:31:37.562
Please, no.


00:31:38.272 --> 00:31:40.022
Within the next 60 minutes,


00:31:40.107 --> 00:31:43.150
you must stay upon the path of learning


00:31:43.235 --> 00:31:45.695
and traverse a series of obstacles


00:31:45.779 --> 00:31:47.947
to obtain access to your wife,


00:31:48.031 --> 00:31:49.991
who you have also deceived.


00:31:50.200 --> 00:31:53.160
If you fail to reach her
before the clock runs out,


00:31:53.620 --> 00:31:54.996
- she will die.
- No.


00:31:55.289 --> 00:31:56.664
Live or die, Bobby?


00:31:56.748 --> 00:31:58.124
Make your choice.


00:33:11.657 --> 00:33:12.823
Bobby!


00:33:14.159 --> 00:33:18.079
Help!


00:33:19.539 --> 00:33:21.415
Let me out!


00:33:31.510 --> 00:33:32.635
Bobby.


00:33:32.719 --> 00:33:36.972
Bobby! What's going on? What's going on?


00:33:37.724 --> 00:33:40.351
Another Jigsaw survivor has come forward.


00:33:41.311 --> 00:33:43.979
As the city stays crippled in fear
from the Jigsaw killings,


00:33:44.481 --> 00:33:47.692
chilling new words from
the latest survivor provide a reminder


00:33:47.776 --> 00:33:51.362
of the physical and mental toll
these deadly games can take.


00:33:52.364 --> 00:33:56.075
This horrible event was happening to me,


00:33:56.410 --> 00:33:59.328
and in that moment,


00:34:00.414 --> 00:34:02.540
that moment that this thing


00:34:03.250 --> 00:34:05.584
threatened to take everything away,


00:34:06.169 --> 00:34:07.753
even the pain,


00:34:10.006 --> 00:34:13.134
I realized what I still had left to give.


00:34:14.177 --> 00:34:16.220
And I didn't want to let that go.


00:34:18.265 --> 00:34:19.932
It gave me light.


00:34:21.643 --> 00:34:25.813
That pure moment
of absolute horror gave me light.


00:34:25.897 --> 00:34:28.274
And as wrong as this may seem,


00:34:29.568 --> 00:34:31.610
I'm better for enduring it.


00:34:32.696 --> 00:34:34.405
I'm stronger.


00:34:35.073 --> 00:34:37.658
And, I must admit, I'm grateful for it.


00:34:38.660 --> 00:34:40.911
I'm grateful it happened to me,


00:34:41.955 --> 00:34:44.331
and I wish the same for everyone like me.


00:34:45.250 --> 00:34:47.626
Joan is but one of a growing
number of citizens...


00:34:47.711 --> 00:34:51.797
If something like that doesn't get you
to change your perspective on life,


00:34:52.507 --> 00:34:54.175
I don't know what will.


00:34:55.469 --> 00:34:56.594
Yeah.


00:34:58.680 --> 00:35:01.223
And if those people weren't so fucked up
after their games,


00:35:01.308 --> 00:35:03.934
they'd make a mint selling their stories.


00:36:09.543 --> 00:36:12.711
That's a real clever design.


00:36:14.422 --> 00:36:16.215
Yours or your husband's?


00:36:16.716 --> 00:36:18.050
- Everything was him.
- Right.


00:36:18.134 --> 00:36:19.385
Well, here's my problem,


00:36:19.469 --> 00:36:23.055
that was left for me,
and your fingerprints were all over it.


00:36:24.391 --> 00:36:26.058
When you told me Hoffman had it in for you,


00:36:26.142 --> 00:36:28.978
you didn't mention that
it was because you tried to kill him.


00:36:31.940 --> 00:36:33.899
There's a new game going on.


00:36:34.401 --> 00:36:35.568
Does that surprise you?


00:36:36.611 --> 00:36:39.363
- No.
- No? No?


00:36:40.532 --> 00:36:42.783
You're crazy, you know that?


00:36:43.535 --> 00:36:45.828
I knew you were crazy
the minute I laid eyes on you.


00:36:45.912 --> 00:36:47.079
Crazy.


00:36:48.248 --> 00:36:52.251
Okay, this is what we're gonna do, crazy.


00:36:53.169 --> 00:36:55.963
Till I catch Mark Hoffman,
this is your new home.


00:36:56.756 --> 00:36:57.756
Get comfy.


00:36:58.717 --> 00:37:00.467
What makes you think he can't find me here?


00:37:00.552 --> 00:37:02.636
Jill, it's a safe house.


00:37:03.179 --> 00:37:05.264
Safe house. Safe. House.


00:37:05.849 --> 00:37:07.141
You get it?


00:37:10.353 --> 00:37:14.481
Gibson, this was sent here addressed to Jill.


00:37:14.566 --> 00:37:18.235
- Hoffman knows our location.
- God damn it. God damn it!


00:37:19.195 --> 00:37:20.195
What?


00:37:21.031 --> 00:37:23.782
We just had a small explosion here in a car
at the crime scene.


00:37:23.867 --> 00:37:24.992
Okay, is anyone hurt?


00:37:25.076 --> 00:37:26.452
Holy shit!


00:37:34.961 --> 00:37:35.961
Rogers?


00:37:36.046 --> 00:37:37.379
Rogers, you okay?


00:37:37.464 --> 00:37:38.422
Yeah.


00:37:38.506 --> 00:37:40.424
Get out of there.
You get the bomb squad to sweep the yard.


00:37:40.508 --> 00:37:42.801
Don't touch anything else until it's clean.


00:37:43.803 --> 00:37:45.304
- Got it.
- All right.


00:37:46.765 --> 00:37:47.932
Play it.


00:37:54.147 --> 00:37:55.272
Hello, Gibson.


00:37:56.274 --> 00:37:57.608
Been a long time.


00:37:58.109 --> 00:37:59.652
What I want is simple,


00:37:59.736 --> 00:38:01.153
give me Jill Tuck.


00:38:01.738 --> 00:38:03.489
You're protecting her despite the fact


00:38:03.573 --> 00:38:05.157
that she had direct knowledge throughout,


00:38:06.284 --> 00:38:09.161
which makes her complicit in every death.


00:38:10.121 --> 00:38:11.747
I'll make you a deal.


00:38:11.831 --> 00:38:13.332
Give her to me,


00:38:14.542 --> 00:38:16.335
the game stops, and no one else dies.


00:38:17.504 --> 00:38:21.006
If not, everyone dies and you'll be to blame.


00:38:22.175 --> 00:38:24.093
Make your choice.


00:38:24.177 --> 00:38:25.678
The clock is ticking.


00:38:28.640 --> 00:38:30.641
Let's get her down to the holding cell
at the station.


00:38:31.101 --> 00:38:33.602
Lock it down.
No one gets in without my authority.


00:38:33.687 --> 00:38:34.853
Got it.


00:38:53.581 --> 00:38:54.707
Oh, my God.


00:38:56.167 --> 00:38:57.167
Oh, God!


00:38:57.252 --> 00:38:58.585
No! Please!


00:38:59.754 --> 00:39:02.506
No! Please, help! Please!


00:39:02.716 --> 00:39:04.133
Please, no!


00:39:04.217 --> 00:39:05.551
God damn it!


00:39:06.553 --> 00:39:08.637
Bobby. Bobby, help me!


00:39:08.722 --> 00:39:10.681
You've got to get me out of here.


00:39:11.725 --> 00:39:13.600
I can't move, Bobby.


00:39:13.977 --> 00:39:15.227
Please, help me!


00:39:15.311 --> 00:39:17.229
Okay, okay, okay. Just relax.


00:39:22.652 --> 00:39:24.987
Help me! Do something!


00:39:27.157 --> 00:39:28.574
Don't leave me.


00:39:30.368 --> 00:39:31.660
Hello, Bobby.


00:39:31.745 --> 00:39:34.872
Before you
is one of your trusted colleagues.


00:39:34.956 --> 00:39:39.710
She has been your publicist for years,
knowing your lies


00:39:39.794 --> 00:39:42.212
but choosing to speak no evil.


00:39:42.297 --> 00:39:45.340
She has been richly rewarded for her words,


00:39:45.425 --> 00:39:49.428
but today she will be rewarded
for her silence.


00:39:49.971 --> 00:39:52.347
In the X-ray, you will see a key,


00:39:52.432 --> 00:39:57.269
the key to Nina's survival,
which will shut off her device.


00:39:57.604 --> 00:39:58.854
But there's a catch.


00:39:58.938 --> 00:40:01.982
You have one minute
to pull the fish hook from her stomach,


00:40:02.067 --> 00:40:03.609
and unlock her device


00:40:05.195 --> 00:40:08.155
or else the four spikes
will penetrate her throat,


00:40:08.239 --> 00:40:10.908
- silencing Nina forever.
- Fuck!


00:40:10.992 --> 00:40:13.243
Remember, the spikes will also advance


00:40:13.328 --> 00:40:18.332
each time the decibel level in this room
rises above a whisper,


00:40:18.416 --> 00:40:20.292
killing her even sooner.


00:40:20.710 --> 00:40:24.463
Will Nina live or die, Bobby?
The choice is yours.


00:40:26.424 --> 00:40:29.551
- Help me. Help!
- No! No!


00:40:33.640 --> 00:40:34.807
Just shut up.


00:40:36.351 --> 00:40:37.935
Stay with me, okay?


00:40:43.900 --> 00:40:45.025
Do it.


00:40:52.450 --> 00:40:54.493
No. No. No.


00:40:55.662 --> 00:40:57.788
Okay, stay with me. Stay with me.


00:40:57.872 --> 00:40:59.456
It's gonna be okay. Look at me.


00:40:59.541 --> 00:41:00.582
Look at me.


00:41:13.471 --> 00:41:15.931
No! Nina, quiet. Nina.


00:41:16.015 --> 00:41:17.599
Please. Please, for me.


00:41:17.684 --> 00:41:19.309
Just shut the fuck up.


00:41:19.394 --> 00:41:21.562
I'm gonna get this out.


00:41:35.535 --> 00:41:37.077
No! No!


00:41:37.912 --> 00:41:41.081
Just do it, Bobby. Just fucking do it.


00:42:08.651 --> 00:42:09.651
Bobby!


00:42:27.754 --> 00:42:29.087
No!


00:42:31.466 --> 00:42:33.759
Why wouldn't you just shut the fuck up?


00:42:35.678 --> 00:42:37.638
You just needed to shut up!


00:42:41.351 --> 00:42:44.269
No! Oh, my God!


00:42:44.938 --> 00:42:47.773
No! Help!


00:42:51.611 --> 00:42:54.029
Help! Help!


00:43:26.354 --> 00:43:28.355
Here you are, ma'am. Take care.


00:43:30.024 --> 00:43:31.650
Ma'am, your name?


00:43:31.734 --> 00:43:34.486
Sara, without an "H."


00:43:35.989 --> 00:43:38.657
I just want to say I love your book so much.


00:43:39.158 --> 00:43:41.994
I just felt like I could feel everything
that you went through.


00:43:42.620 --> 00:43:44.288
I feel like it changed my life.


00:43:44.539 --> 00:43:46.206
I appreciate that, ma'am.


00:43:47.375 --> 00:43:49.835
I really do. Thank you.


00:43:51.170 --> 00:43:52.838
Thank you.


00:44:00.680 --> 00:44:02.097
Your name, sir?


00:44:02.181 --> 00:44:03.181
John.


00:44:04.517 --> 00:44:07.269
With an "H," without an "H,"
it doesn't matter.


00:44:07.353 --> 00:44:09.813
We'll go with John with an "H" this time.


00:44:09.897 --> 00:44:12.524
You got quite an army working for you here,
don't you?


00:44:13.401 --> 00:44:15.110
Must be spreading a pretty good word.


00:44:15.194 --> 00:44:18.488
Well, we try to reach as many
people as possible, you know?


00:44:18.573 --> 00:44:20.782
You don't see anything wrong with that?


00:44:21.200 --> 00:44:23.493
No. No, sir, I don't.


00:44:27.373 --> 00:44:28.623
You know,


00:44:30.001 --> 00:44:31.710
history is a passion for me.


00:44:32.211 --> 00:44:34.963
And in ancient Egypt
if you were speaking under oath,


00:44:35.048 --> 00:44:36.465
you were required to say,


00:44:36.549 --> 00:44:41.470
"If I'm lying, take me to the quarries."


00:44:43.848 --> 00:44:45.807
That mean anything to you?


00:44:45.892 --> 00:44:48.310
No, sir. No, sir, it doesn't.


00:44:48.895 --> 00:44:50.771
Well, I'll tell you what it means.


00:44:50.855 --> 00:44:54.399
It means if you knowingly lied
on the public record


00:44:55.860 --> 00:44:57.819
that you were subject
to a period of enslavement.


00:44:57.904 --> 00:44:59.738
What are you implying here, sir?


00:44:59.822 --> 00:45:01.406
I'm not implying anything.


00:45:01.991 --> 00:45:04.242
Move along, buddy. He signed your book.


00:45:05.953 --> 00:45:07.704
Thanks for the signature.


00:45:08.664 --> 00:45:11.208
Nice picture, but I don't need it.


00:45:12.251 --> 00:45:13.585
We've met.


00:45:26.808 --> 00:45:28.975
Adam, Gibson says he wants
you on these right away.


00:45:29.060 --> 00:45:30.268
They're from the junkyard.


00:45:35.566 --> 00:45:37.442
Make your choice.


00:45:37.902 --> 00:45:39.361
The clock is ticking.


00:45:40.238 --> 00:45:41.238
See that?


00:45:42.365 --> 00:45:43.365
Yeah.


00:45:44.617 --> 00:45:46.451
I know that from somewhere.


00:45:47.370 --> 00:45:50.080
Hey, I've got something over here.


00:45:51.833 --> 00:45:54.709
We might know who's in the game.
This was just sent to us.


00:45:54.794 --> 00:45:57.796
It was taken
from a security camera downtown.


00:45:57.880 --> 00:45:59.548
The guy's name is Bobby Dagen.


00:45:59.632 --> 00:46:00.799
- Familiar?
- No.


00:46:00.883 --> 00:46:04.261
He's a Jigsaw survivor
who's milking it on talk shows.


00:46:04.679 --> 00:46:07.305
His wife and handlers are also missing.


00:46:35.877 --> 00:46:37.085
Joyce?


00:46:38.629 --> 00:46:40.297
Who is it? Who's there?


00:46:41.007 --> 00:46:42.340
- Suzanne.
- Who is that?


00:46:42.425 --> 00:46:44.342
For fuck's sake, Bobby. Bobby.


00:46:44.844 --> 00:46:46.094
